cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you reference ExecutionProof in academic or research work, please cite it as below."
title: "ExecutionProof — Pre-Execution Governance Layer for Consequential AI Actions"
abstract: >-
  ExecutionProof is an independent pre-execution governance layer for
  consequential AI actions. It verifies an agent's authority, evidence,
  constraints, and execution control before an action runs, returning an
  ALLOW / HOLD / DENY decision and issuing a tamper-evident ProofRecord for
  every decision. Payment authorization is the first production deployment
  boundary; the same architecture governs infrastructure commands, data
  release, access changes, and other irreversible actions. This repository is
  the product-grade reference for the ExecutionProof API, architecture, and
  deployment model, governed by the RF-100 verified-execution standard.
